                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16660726" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 14:22:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It might be the same problems as in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9928&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;IGNITE-9928&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752020" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 08:25:10 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;Spring&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2899073]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 0 Exit Code &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridServiceInjectionSpringResourceTest.testDeployServiceWithSpring (last started)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2896511&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752025" author="rkondakov" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 08:34:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, patch is ready for review. Tests look good. Spring suite is not a blocker - the same problems exist in the master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752468" author="amashenkov" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 17:17:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, looks like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;newValue&quot; is set to&#160;GridCacheUpdateTxResult unconditionally, however it useful only if a continuous query needs the &quot;newValue&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;there is a flag &quot;needOldValue&quot; (as mvccSet method param) that force us to retrieve old value for continuous query as the only purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Les&apos;t refactor this flag and use as condition for return both &quot;old&quot; and &quot;new&quot; values via GridCacheUpdateTxResult, if it is possible.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754082" author="amashenkov" created="Mon, 28 Jan 2019 15:46:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve found newValue is the value that passed to backups. So, PR is ok, we just have to add missed newValue() call.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755946" author="amashenkov" created="Wed, 30 Jan 2019 10:06:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The test will be broken with &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10976&quot; title=&quot;MVCC: Sql API methods should throw proper TransactionExceptions in case of tx failure.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10976&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10976&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Let&apos;s make proper Mvcc write conflict checks after 10976 will be merged and re-run TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16759999" author="ignitetcbot" created="Mon, 4 Feb 2019 16:35:47 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2994874&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16760002" author="rkondakov" created="Mon, 4 Feb 2019 16:38:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=gvvinblade&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;gvvinblade&quot;&gt;gvvinblade&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve merged patch with updated master and fixed MVCC write conflict handling. TC looks good. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16762682" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 7 Feb 2019 13:42:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve left a comment to the PR.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are 2 places where you check Exception messages.&lt;br/&gt;
It is not clear, why transaction rollback is expected.&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Also we can add checks if exception cause&#160;belongs to certain TransactionException classes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16774914" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 22 Feb 2019 08:48:48 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3144164&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16774919" author="rkondakov" created="Fri, 22 Feb 2019 08:50:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;. I&apos;ve removed tx rollback exception checking and left only write conflict check. Tests look good. Patch is ready for review and merge.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16774926" author="rkondakov" created="Fri, 22 Feb 2019 09:01:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Oops! I&apos;ve fixed exception handling only in the one place of two ones you mentioned. Will fix it soon.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16775140" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 22 Feb 2019 13:32:41 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3153166&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16775143" author="rkondakov" created="Fri, 22 Feb 2019 13:33:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16784183" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 5 Mar 2019 07:29:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, could you please re-merge the ticket with master and re-run tests? Probably it is a bit outdated at the moment.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16784404" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 5 Mar 2019 13:03:37 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
